        "original_id": "5016e84e-9e38-5270-abaa-b065e3464b3b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: August R. Lindt\n- Organizations: UNICEF, United Nations High Commissioner for Refugees (UNHCR), Nobel Peace Prize\n- Roles: Chairman of UNICEF, United Nations High Commissioner for Refugees\n\nFacts:\n- August R. Lindt served as Chairman of UNICEF from 1953 to 1954.\n- The United Nations High Commissioner for Refugees (UNHCR) won the Nobel Peace Prize in 1954.\n- August R. Lindt served as United Nations High Commissioner for Refugees from 1956 to 1960.\n- The United Nations High Commissioner for Refugees (UNHCR) won the Nobel Peace Prize again in 1981.",
